estion rather than killed.</td></tr><tr><td class="ln"><strong>&lt;code&gt;core_health.flat&lt;/code&gt; as a safety signal</strong></td><td class="ln"><span class="tag pill-dontarm">FAULT</span></td><td class="ln">It is tournament-scoped and it says the desk is flat while the venue is long four lots. BUILD item: make it read the venue position line, or rename it.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr class="frag-sep"><h3 id="run_charts">THE RUN CHARTS &mdash; every fill of the week, marked on the day&rsquo;s own price path</h3><div class="card"><svg class="runchart" viewBox="0 0 980 380" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Monday 17 Aug - US session +$437.00 on 8 trades — price path with trade entries and exits" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="background:#fcfcfb;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif">
