<div class="callout"><div class="ct">HONEST MONEY &mdash; ceiling vs what we banked</div><table><tr><th></th><th>Runs</th><th>Hindsight ceiling</th><th>What we really made</th></tr><tr class="row-hl"><td>Caught (aligned)</td><td class="num">4</td><td class="num">$1038</td><td class="num">+$618 &nbsp;(60%)</td></tr><tr class="row-bad"><td>Fought (against)</td><td class="num">1</td><td class="num">$224</td><td class="num">$-1288</td></tr><tr><td>Sat out</td><td class="num">65</td><td class="num">$9986</td><td class="num">$0 &larr; the money on the table</td></tr></table><p>The runs made money and the fading gave it back; we convert a fraction of the ceiling and ignore the rest. The next two movements ask whether we can do better &mdash; first with the gates we own, then with new ones.</p></div><hr class="frag-sep"><h3 id="movement1_census_MGC">THE SAME CENSUS ON GOLD &mdash; MGC, the second instrument</h3><h2><span class="n">M1</span> The biggest runs on MGC this week &mdash; did we show up?</h2>
