<h3>8. ★ THE CHOP-DAY SCALP LAB &mdash; can we stop donating on chop days?</h3>

<p class="lead">You asked for something specific: the trend days carry the profit, the chop days donate, so build a purpose-built chop-turn scalper, catch the oscillation turns, bank tiny, and <strong>lead with the order book</strong>. It was built &mdash; nine named candidates, <strong>290,700 five-second decision points across eighteen trading days, 25.2 million trade ticks, 5.06 million ten-deep book snapshots and 33.9 million level-1 book updates at 41 milliseconds</strong>, everything raced tick by tick at $1.50 the round trip. <strong>The answer is no, and it is a clean no with two named causes of death. But the premise needs correcting, and the correction is worth about $5,400.</strong></p>

